msgstr "Dokumentace API uvádí [`qiskit_bosons.circuit.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library#module-qiskit_bosons.circuit.library \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library\") pro hradla, [`qiskit_bosons.linalg`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/linalg#module-qiskit_bosons.linalg \"qiskit_bosons.linalg\") pro dekompozici a [`qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes#module-qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes\") pro syntézní pluginy.\n"

